00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,148
Malaria control, vaccines and clean water stopped people dying young, while families stayed large.

2
00:00:07,148 --> 00:00:10,091
Growth peaked at two point six percent a year.

3
00:00:10,091 --> 00:00:20,078
And now, the 2021 census: twenty nine million, but growing at just zero point nine two percent, the slowest in a hundred and ten years.

4
00:00:20,078 --> 00:00:21,315
Why the slowdown?

5
00:00:21,315 --> 00:00:23,841
And what makes the people who are here fall ill?

